        "original_id": "30718257-72b8-5c39-9164-44cebfbf6d28",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michelle Dockery, Jaume Collet-Serra, Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Lupita Nyong'o, Scoot McNairy\n- Works: Non-Stop, Downton Abbey\n- Organizations: ITV, PBS, Emmy Awards, Golden Globe Awards\n- Topics: film, television, acting awards\n\nFacts:\n- Downton Abbey aired from 2010 to 2015 as a television period drama series on ITV in the UK and PBS in the U.S.\n- Michelle Dockery is most widely known for playing Lady Mary Crawley in Downton Abbey.\n- Michelle Dockery received three consecutive Emmy Award nominations for Outstanding Lead Actress in a Drama Series and one Golden Globe Award nomination for Downton Abbey.\n- Non-Stop is a 2014 American mystery action thriller film directed by Jaume Collet-Serra.\n- Non-Stop stars Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Michelle Dockery, Lupita Nyong'o, and Scoot McNairy.",
